bottled-hckrnws
================

This repository packages hckrnws for Cloud in a Bottle.

hckrnws
--------
This image builds and distributes hckrnws, an alternative Hacker News reader.

  Upstream:   https://github.com/rajatkulkarni95/hckrnws
  Copyright:  Copyright (c) 2021 Rajat Kulkarni
  License:    MIT
  Built from: commit 7b71e87c23be2f0608a48ff916d9f2767e092c36

The complete source corresponding to the hckrnws build is available at:

  https://github.com/rajatkulkarni95/hckrnws/tree/7b71e87c23be2f0608a48ff916d9f2767e092c36

hckrnws is built without source modifications. Its compiled files and license
are copied into the runtime image by the Dockerfile.

